     {
      "date": "December 10, 2023",
      "description": "Announced the Hero Equipment."
     },
     {
      "date": "December 12, 2023",
      "description": "Split previous abilities into two different Equipment for each Hero and leveling them up to appropriate level based on the Town Hall level:; Barbarian King's Iron Fist: Rage Vial and Barbarian Puppet; Archer Queen's Royal Cloak: Invisibility Vial and Archer Puppet; Grand Warden's Eternal Tome and passive Life Aura: Eternal Tome and Life Gem; Royal Champion's Seeking Shield: Seeking Shield and Royal Gem; Added new Equipment for most Heroes:; Barbarian King: Earthquake Boots and Vampstache; Archer Queen: Giant Arrow and Healer Puppet; Grand Warden: Rage Gem and Healing Tome"
     },
